              'Ask each learner for a few short paragraphs of their own text (a clause set, a policy, an account list; nothing confidential) saved one passage per line in a text file, for the optional live run on the own-work slide: `python demo_runs/s04/s04_search.py --file their_file.txt "description"`.',
              'All texts in the demonstration are invented for the course (Nile Valley Foods is fictional). Say so.',
